{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12383","headline":"奉和杜相公移长兴宅奉呈元相公 · 钱起","name":"奉和杜相公移长兴宅奉呈元相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"守贵常思俭，平津此意深。\n能卑丞相宅，何谢故人心。\n种蕙初抽带，移篁不改阴。\n院梅朝助鼎，池凤夕归林。\n觉路经中得，沧州梦里寻。\n道高仍济代，恩重岂投簪。\n报国谁知己，推贤共作霖。\n兴来文雅振，清韵掷双金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}